# Connect my GitHub so I can directly select and pull raw TTL vocabulary files from my public repositories into the manager.

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OpenREL - Open Rights Encoding language
# Version 0.4 (Draft)
# Developed by Melios Katsamakis and Prodromos Tsiavos (OpenAIRE), and Wim Hugo (DANS/ EUDAT)
# This Version: 6 July 2026
